\end_layout

\end_inset

To analyze the solution to 
\begin_inset Formula $p(z)+uq(z)=0$
\end_inset

,
 consider 
\begin_inset Formula $B(z)=p^{2}-u^{2}q^{2}=z^{4}(z^{2}+1)\Lambda(z)$
\end_inset

,
 where 
